# Manifests

- Read `manifests/AI-INSTRUCTIONS.md` and the relevant subfolder instructions.
- Preserve ownership fields; do not reassign domains without an explicit request.
- Keep `domains/` and `migration-waves/` examples consistent with docs and checklists.
- Prefer extending example YAML over inventing production domain lists.
- When wave order or dependencies change, update related cutover checklist guidance.
